to-be-incorporated-into-paper-lines-80 : List (List Word)
to-be-incorporated-into-paper-lines-80 = cons "" (cons "Each cell has one principal port; a step rewrites two cells whose principal ports meet. No rule" (cons "consults an environment or context. Being under a face such as `i = 0` is a substitution of the" (cons "dimension by the endpoint. Applying a dimension binder puts a substitution cell on its body, and" (cons "that substitution re-activates exactly the stuck values it unblocks: `p @ i` under `i := 0` becomes" (cons "the left endpoint of `p`. The step count is fixed by the term: identical with any number of worker" (cons "threads. Reading a stored value" (cons "costs the same whether or not the value has arrived: a read that arrives first waits on the wire" (cons "and is served the same one-level copy, and waiting is not a step. Every reading is taken over the" (cons "complete normalization of what was posed. A worker locks the active pair and the cells it rewires," (cons "in address order, and revalidates before rewriting." nil))))))))))
